((id "T47")
 (title "Parse pytest, dotnet test and rackunit output so `done` shows the first failing test")
 (status done)
 (priority 1)
 (goal
  "Recognise the runner from the command or output and emit at most 3 findings per failed check with test id, file:line and the first message line (raw tail behind --full); today dotnet test loses the first failures and clips file:line, and pytest is readable only with -q.")
